How many times does the lambda passed to `map` run? The program prints the count.

```java
void main() {
    int[] calls = {0};
    var first = Stream.of(1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6)
            .map(n -> { calls[0]++; return n * 10; })
            .filter(n -> n > 25)
            .findFirst();
    IO.println(calls[0]);
}
```

